      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blain%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Newport & Sherman's Valley Railroad arrived in 1892, first train Jan 18, boosting trade and connecting Blain to wider markets.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
